  Some  month  ago  (about  8 or more) I released an  FRONT END with included
  lastcallers  ...   But that one was SOOOOO buggy, slow and lame allover!  I
  put  the  idea  of  making  an  lastcallers  to  the big box under my table
  fullfilled  with  ideas UNRELEASABLE in arexx ...  But after trying, coding
  and imprroving my skill i grabbed it out again and it`s smashing!  I got an
  Idea  to  find  out  the LAST CALLER without reading the callerslog line by
  line  and  WITHOUT  taking  the same caller twice or more (most LASTCALLERS
  don`t  care about the last caller still processed!  eg.  you call your last
  callers  once  it`ll read out the data of the last caller and put it to the
  bullfile!   if  you call it the second time same procedure ...  but why the
  hell the same user should be put to the lastcallers bullfile?  I fixed this
  neet bug by creating a 2nd datafile with the last callers dataline in it!)

  I  also didn`t mind of the length of the callerslog ..  it`s always running
  same speed ...  And it`s finding the LAST caller 100%

  But  what do i`ve to say now ...  Just that you should install it and check
  it  your  own!

                       Signed : fLI7e oF sAD^HJB^KLF^CS!







