       Recognices Last user In LASTCALLER BULLFILE to prevent of double
                              entrys in Bullfile

      Can handle Connects up to 128000 (hahaha) (64000 is ISDN i guess!)

                     Recognices F2 or SYSOP local logins!

                Count upload/download time >or< ONLINE time!

                             User Definable header

    Daily Status: New Users/Day, Uploads & kbytes, Downloads & kbytes
                      Pw Hacks/Day, Pages/Day and more

                                  Nice layout

                 Real fast if you remember it`s an arexx door!

  You can decide if you want to have the ACTIVITIES legend displayed or not!

  Now the SAD-KEY routine has been included! So if you have the SAD-KEY this
    door will automatically be registered and all soon coming doors, too!







